OL,3,AEight German state premiers back Merz
OL,4,Aamid speculation over future
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leaders of eight German states have
OL,7,Fbacked the nation's chancellor amid
OL,8,Fgrowing speculation about his political
OL,9,Ffuture.
OL,11,FThe premiers - all of whom are part of
OL,12,FFriedrich Merz's Christian Democratic
OL,13,FUnion (CDU) - wrote that restoring
OL,14,Ftrust in their party lay in "listening
OL,15,Fb@Kand taking political action, not in
OL,16,Fdebates b@Kover personnel".
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
