OL,3,AEight German state premiers back Merz
OL,4,Aamid speculation over future
OL,5,
OL,6,FMerz, who has only held the post for 16
OL,7,Fmonths, is facing poor approval ratings
OL,8,Fwhile the anti-immigration, far-right
OL,9,FAlternative for Germany (AfD) party is
OL,10,Fsurging, prompting questions about
OL,11,Fwhether he is an electoral liability.
OL,13,FHe has vowed to carry on but two more
OL,14,Fstate elections on Sunday have been
OL,15,Fseen as a key test of his leadership.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
